# This repository is a fork of somebody else's project: the Swift Jinja
# template engine, whose upstream history is in this checkout and whose
# commits still arrive from it. Wisent's own changes here are small and
# deliberate, and they are kept in the shape upstream wrote so that pulling a
# new release stays a merge rather than a rewrite. Renaming or splitting the
# engine's files would make every later merge a conflict in code nobody here
# owns, which costs more than the layout is worth.
#
# The engine itself: lexer, parser, interpreter, environment, filters, tests.
Sources/Jinja/
Tests/JinjaTests/
